{"1869130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demon Seed", "steam_appid": 1869130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/ae520b58fd76c0ebc61fc15fd1a6abf7.poster.avif?t=1775640416\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/ae520b58fd76c0ebc61fc15fd1a6abf7.webm?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/ae520b58fd76c0ebc61fc15fd1a6abf7.mp4?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/3a2bb21293a4a8e3431feaed2d7094e3.poster.avif?t=1775640416\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/3a2bb21293a4a8e3431feaed2d7094e3.webm?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/3a2bb21293a4a8e3431feaed2d7094e3.mp4?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a city crawling with brainless demons. Sounds like a typical Monday? Not this time. Explore and scavenge the city to find anything that can help you survive. Look deep within your soul, unlock your hidden potential… or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/ff2c6a09b80ba84bf5dd663b74f6b3bc.webp?t=1775640416\" width=440 height=43 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/1622bca633b409eff676e7f81588caaa.poster.avif?t=1775640416\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/1622bca633b409eff676e7f81588caaa.webm?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/1622bca633b409eff676e7f81588caaa.mp4?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full co-op story mode that unlocks Endless Mode once completed, plus a dedicated Arena mode where you battle bosses and upgrade your gear - all of it playable with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/166ef558cc2ee5bf56029dd6cb4dc24e.webp?t=1775640416\" width=440 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/a0a8b4b2ff99388fce2cbe84faf7b1e5.poster.avif?t=1775640416\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/a0a8b4b2ff99388fce2cbe84faf7b1e5.webm?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869130/extras/a0a8b4b2ff99388fce2cbe84faf7b1e5.mp4?t=1775640416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-to-hand combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"b